den's Next Step list (spec, "Look and layout"): two lines per Work Item, a rust
tick and the selected fill on the current row, Waiting On someone else dimmed.
Rust windows the rows to the plate's height and draws each one on its own
(`ListRow`): a `for` over the rows would clone the whole row list once per
element, so a tall plate cost the square of its row count.

Sentinels as in frame.crepus. Meaning never rides on colour alone: the tick is a
glyph, Waiting On and "unattributed" are words, incomplete data has a glyph.

--- List
div w-full h-full flex-col bg-[#aa0000] pt-1
  div h-[1] flex-row px-2 text-[#aa000a]
    span flex-1 "{list_label}"
    span w-[16] text-[#aa0008] "{position}"
  div h-[1]
  div flex-1

--- Empty
div w-full h-full flex-col bg-[#aa0000] pt-1
  div h-[1] px-2 text-[#aa000a] "{list_label}"
  div flex-1
  div h-[1] text-center font-bold text-[#aa0006] "{empty_title}"
  for item in lines
    div h-[1] text-center text-[#aa0008] "{text}"
  div flex-1

--- ListRow
div w-full h-full flex-col bg-[#aa0000]
  if {selected}
    div h-[2] flex-col bg-[#aa0017]
      div h-[1] flex-row
        span w-[2] text-[#aa000b] "{tick}"
        span w-[20] font-bold text-[#aa0009] "{step}"
        span w-[2] text-[#aa000f] "{flag}"
        span flex-1 text-[#aa000a] "{repo} {reference}"
        span w-[5] text-[#aa0008] "{age}"
      div h-[1] flex-row
        span w-[2] text-[#aa000b] "{tick}"
        span w-[2] " "
        span flex-1 text-[#aa0006] "{title}"
        span w-[14] text-[#aa0007] "{waiting}"
  else if {dimmed}
    div h-[2] flex-col text-[#aa0008]
      div h-[1] flex-row
        span w-[2] " "
        span w-[20] "{step}"
        span w-[2] "{flag}"
        span flex-1 "{repo} {reference}"
        span w-[5] "{age}"
      div h-[1] flex-row
        span w-[4] " "
        span flex-1 "{title}"
        span w-[14] "{waiting}"
  else if {has_step}
    div h-[2] flex-col
      div h-[1] flex-row
        span w-[2] " "
        span w-[20] text-[#aa0009] "{step}"
        span w-[2] text-[#aa000f] "{flag}"
        span flex-1 text-[#aa000a] "{repo} {reference}"
        span w-[5] text-[#aa0008] "{age}"
      div h-[1] flex-row
        span w-[4] " "
        span flex-1 text-[#aa0005] "{title}"
        span w-[14] text-[#aa0007] "{waiting}"
  else
    div h-[2] flex-col
      div h-[1] flex-row
        span w-[2] " "
        span w-[20] text-[#aa0008] "{step}"
        span w-[2] text-[#aa000f] "{flag}"
        span flex-1 text-[#aa000a] "{repo} {reference}"
        span w-[5] text-[#aa0008] "{age}"
      div h-[1] flex-row
        span w-[4] " "
        span flex-1 text-[#aa0005] "{title}"
        span w-[14] text-[#aa0007] "{waiting}"
